 menu-item-2523\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/c\/Beikebiotech\/videos\">Testimonials<\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul><\/div>        <style>\n            .mobile-menu-module[data-module=\"tb_1xvq647\"]{\n                right:-300px            }\n        <\/style>\n    <\/div>\n<!-- \/module menu -->\n        <\/div>\n                    <div  data-lazy=\"1\" class=\"module_column sub_column col4-1 tb_hcp4647 last\">\n                            <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n        <!-- module fancy heading -->\n<div  class=\"module module-fancy-heading tb_2ios647  tb_hide_divider\" data-lazy=\"1\">\n        <h3 class=\"fancy-heading tf_textc\">\n    <span class=\"main-head tf_block\">\n                    Why Choose Us            <\/span>\n\n    \n    <span class=\"sub-head tf_block tf_rel\">\n                                <\/span>\n    <\/h3>\n<\/div>\n<!-- \/module fancy heading -->\n        <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n                        <div  data-lazy=\"1\" class=\"module_row themify_builder_row tb_gk1c388 tf_w\">\n                        <div class=\"row_inner col_align_top tb_col_count_1 tf_box tf_rel\">\n                        <div  data-lazy=\"1\" class=\"module_column tb-column col-full tb_hwhv389 first\">\n                            <div  data-lazy=\"1\" class=\"module_subrow themify_builder_sub_row tf_w col_align_top tb_col_count_2 tb_zj896\">\n                <div  data-lazy=\"1\" class=\"module_column sub_column col4-2 tb_6hsh6 first\">\n                    <!-- module text -->\n<div  class=\"module module-text tb_uz33998   \" data-lazy=\"1\">\n        <div  class=\"tb_text_wrap\">\n        <p><strong>Our Strength<\/strong><\/p>    <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<!-- \/module text --><!-- module text -->\n<div  class=\"module module-text tb_k1n4799   \" data-lazy=\"1\">\n        <div  class=\"tb_text_wrap\">\n        <p>23 century and Beike had a distinguished scientist team and a powerful scientific research network alliance that constructed over 400 team members working on different disciplines such as clinical medicine, molecular biology, biochemistry, cytobiology, genetics, clinical laboratory science, and hematology.<\/p>\n<p>Beike Biotechnology has over a decade of experience and expertise in immune cell and stem cell research, development, treatment and even running a stem cell hospitals. With their strong scientific research cooperation alliance with renowned universities and research institutes worldwide, such as\u00a0<strong>VA Hospital of Stanford University, Huazhong University of Science and Technology, Sun Yat-sen University, Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen High School, Tsinghua University, Zhengzhou University, Institute of Blood Transfusion, Academy of Military Medical Sciences, Beijing Wuzuze Technology Development Foundation, Navy general hospital of PLA, Xijing Hospital<\/strong>\u00a0and\u00a0<strong>The Fourth Military Medical University<\/strong>\u00a0allows them to continue advancing in the area of immune cell and stem cell treatment.<\/p>    <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<!-- \/module text -->        <\/div>\n                    <div  data-lazy=\"1\" class=\"module_column sub_column col4-2 tb_9px8642 last\">\n                    <!-- module text -->\n<div  class=\"module module-text tb_6j9c734   \" data-lazy=\"1\">\n        <div  class=\"tb_text_wrap\">\n        <p><strong>Our Vision<\/strong><\/p>    <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<!-- \/module text --><!-- module text -->\n<div  class=\"module module-text tb_vrye682   \" data-lazy=\"1\">\n        <div  class=\"tb_text_wrap\">\n        <p style=\"text-align: left;\">23 Century Life Science desires to establish the largest advance cell centre in South East Asia equip with latest technology and expertise from Beike Biotechnology and a state-of-the-art cGMP laboratory fulfilling the requirement of CGTP (cell &amp; gene therapy products), ASEAN Common Technical Dossier (ACTD) and Pharmaceutical Inspection Co-operation Scheme (PICS). Our aim is to promote health by providing hope to patients who suffer from diseases which are incurable from modern medicines using cells as a treatment option.<\/p>    <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<!-- \/module text -->        <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n                <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n                        <div  data-css_id=\"zx0t725\" data-lazy=\"1\" class=\"module_row themify_builder_row fullwidth_row_container tb_zx0t725 tf_w\">\n                        <div class=\"row_inner col_align_top tb_col_count_1 tf_box tf_rel\">\n                        <div  data-lazy=\"1\" class=\"module_column tb-column col-full tb_get0725 first\">\n                    <!-- module accordion -->\n<div  class=\"module module-accordion tb_8f3g252 \" data-behavior=\"toggle\" data-lazy=\"1\">\n    \n    <ul class=\"ui module-accordion   tb_default_color\">\n            <li class=\"builder-accordion-active\">\n            <div class=\"accordion-title tf_rel\">\n                <a href=\"#acc-8f3g252-0\" class=\"tb_title_accordion\" aria-controls=\"acc-8f3g252-0-content\" aria-expanded=\"true\">\n                                                            1. Technological Superiority                <\/a>\n            <\/div><!-- .accordion-title -->\n            <div id=\"acc-8f3g252-0-content\" data-id=\"acc-8f3g252-0\" aria-hidden=\"false\" class=\"accordion-content tf_clearfix\">\n                        <div  data-lazy=\"1\" class=\"module_subrow themify_builder_sub_row tf_w col_align_top tb_col_count_1 tb_8gts589\">\n                <div  data-lazy=\"1\" class=\"module_column sub_column tb_msol590 first\">\n                    <!-- module text -->\n<div  class=\"module module-text tb_fb5i590   \" data-lazy=\"1\">\n        <div  class=\"tb_text_wrap\">\n        <ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/23century.my\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/23-century-patents-list-owned.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">67 International &amp; National Patents<\/a><\/li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Advisory Board for Cell Preparation Standards\/Guideline<\/li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Cell seed purification technology (International Patent)<\/li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">4th generation Cell Manufacturing &gt; 80% cell viability<\/li>\n<\/ul>    <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<!-- \/module text -->        <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n                    <\/div><!-- .accordion-content -->\n        <\/li>\n            <li class=\"builder-accordion-active\">\n            <div class=\"accordion-title tf_rel\">\n                <a href=\"#acc-8f3g252-1\" class=\"tb_title_accordion\" aria-controls=\"acc-8f3g252-1-content\" aria-expanded=\"true\">\n                                                            2. Quality Assurance                <\/a>\n            <\/div><!-- .accordion-title -->\n            <div id=\"acc-8f3g252-1-content\" data-id=\"acc-8f3g252-1\" aria-hidden=\"false\" class=\"accordion-content tf_clearfix\">\n                        <div  data-lazy=\"1\" class=\"module_subrow themify_builder_sub_row tf_w col_align_top tb_col_count_1 tb_vgcl590\">\n                <div  data-lazy=\"1\" class=\"module_column sub_column tb_fo21590 first\">\n                    <!-- module text -->\n<div  class=\"module module-text tb_c7od590   \" data-lazy=\"1\">\n        <div  class=\"tb_text_wrap\">\n        <ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Manufacturing process that passed the audit of the National Drug Regulatory<\/li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Highest clean room standard (Grade B,A)<\/li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Third party testing (Clinical Grade approved by NPRA)<\/li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">More than 45 types of main raw materials approved for clinical grade<\/li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Every cell must be traceable with 24 hours surveillance<\/li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Stringent test before the final product will be release out from laboratory<\/li>\n<\/ul>    <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<!-- \/module text -->        <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n                    <\/div><!-- .accordion-content -->\n        <\/li>\n            <li class=\"builder-accordion-active\">\n            <div class=\"accordion-title tf_rel\">\n                <a href=\"#acc-8f3g252-2\" class=\"tb_title_accordion\" aria-controls=\"acc-8f3g252-2-content\" aria-expanded=\"true\">\n                                                            3. Clinical Advantages                <\/a>\n            <\/div><!-- .accordion-title -->\n            <div id=\"acc-8f3g252-2-content\" data-id=\"acc-8f3g252-2\" aria-hidden=\"false\" class=\"accordion-content tf_clearfix\">\n                        <div  data-lazy=\"1\" class=\"module_subrow themify_builder_sub_row tf_w col_align_top tb_col_count_1 tb_ajof590\">\n                <div  data-lazy=\"1\" class=\"module_column sub_column tb_8i6v590 first\">\n                    <!-- module text -->\n<div  class=\"module module-text tb_c5ta590   \" data-lazy=\"1\">\n        <div  class=\"tb_text_wrap\">\n        <ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Beike has carried out more than 20,000 cellular clinical studies and application in more than 70 countries globally<\/li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">We are one of the largest and most comprehensive stem cell research institution in the world today<\/li>\n<\/ul>    <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<!-- \/module text -->        <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n                    <\/div><!-- .accordion-content -->\n        <\/li>\n        <\/ul>\n\n<\/div><!-- \/module accordion -->        <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n                        <div  data-lazy=\"1\" class=\"module_row themify_builder_row tb_mqph642 tf_w hide-mobile\">\n                        <div class=\"row_inner col_align_middle tb_col_count_3 tf_box tf_rel\">\n                        <div  data-lazy=\"1\" class=\"module_col